{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--shizunai-eci-marks-nominative-and-objective","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai Ainu, both the nominative and the objective cases of the second-person plural are marked by the prefix eci-.","ja":"静内方言において、二人称複数の主格と目的格はいずれも接頭辞 eci- で標示される。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0210-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0211-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--eci-composed-of-e-and-ci","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--second-neutral"],"statement":{"en":"The second-person plural affix eci- may be analyzed as consisting of the second-person singular affix e- plus ci-, which in turn may be identical with the first-person plural subject affix.","ja":"二人称複数接辞 eci- は二人称単数接辞 e- に ci- が付加されたものと分析でき、この ci- は一人称複数主格接辞と同一である可能性がある。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-","e-","ci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0210-04","stance":"proposes"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0211-04","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-sakhalin-ainu-nouns-with-the-second-person","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--plural-marking"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, nouns with the second-person plural prefix eci- often co-occur with the plural suffix -hcin, as in eci-macihi-hcin 'your wives'.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、二人称複数接頭辞 eci- を持つ名詞は複数接尾辞 -hcin と共起することが比較的多い（例：eci-macihi-hcin「お前たちの妻たち」）。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-","-hcin"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2022@handbook-epub/l0134-26","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-the-chikabumi-dialect-eshi-is-used-for","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--plural-marking"],"statement":{"en":"In the Chikabumi dialect, eshi- is used for the second-person plural nominative.","ja":"近文方言では第II人称複数に eshi- を用いる。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/central/asahikawa"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eshi-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0080-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-suffix-yan-is-an-incorporating-personal-affix","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--plural-marking"],"statement":{"en":"The suffix -yan is an incorporating personal affix of first-person singular and second-person plural.","ja":"-yan は一人称単数と二人称複数との抱合人称接辞である。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-yan"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0046-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-karafuto-ainu-when-a-first-person-subject","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--plural-marking"],"statement":{"en":"In Karafuto Ainu, when a first-person subject is combined with a second person, the plurality of a second-person object is marked by the presence or absence of -an.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、1人称主語が2人称と組み合わされる際、2人称目的語名詞の複数性は -an の有無によって標示される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-an"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:tangiku2022@handbook-epub/l0060-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--southern-hokkaido-ainu-dialects-have-several-portmanteau-personal","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"Southern Hokkaido Ainu dialects have several portmanteau personal affixes that combine cross-referencing for both A and O.","ja":"南北海道アイヌ語方言には、AとOの両方の照応を兼ね備えるいわゆるかばん人称接辞が複数存在する。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2008@pdftotext-pieces/l0011-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-southern-hokkaido-ainu-the-combination-of-a","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"In Southern Hokkaido Ainu, the combination of a first-person A and a second-person O is invariably marked with the portmanteau prefix eci= rather than analytical combinations.","ja":"南北海道アイヌ語において、1人称Aと2人称Oの組み合わせは分析的な複合辞ではなく常にポートマントー接辞 eci= で標示される。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0009-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-saru-ainu-instead-of-combining-the-first","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"In Saru Ainu, instead of combining the first-person singular subject prefix ku- and the second-person singular object prefix e- into *ku-e, the second-person plural marker eci- is used instead.","ja":"沙流方言のアイヌ語では、1人称単数主語接頭辞ku-と2人称単数目的語接頭辞e-を組み合わせて*ku-eとする代わりに、通常は2人称複数主語/目的語の標識であるeci-を用いる。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["1SG.A acting on 2SG.O"]},"forms":["eci-","ku-","e-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2022@handbook-epub/l0005-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-spoken-hokkaido-ainu-a-first-person-subject","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"In spoken Hokkaido Ainu, a first-person subject acting on a second-person object is expressed by echi- (in Iburi: e-...-ash for singular object, echi-...-ash for plural object).","ja":"北海道アイヌ語口語において、第1人称主格から第2人称目的格への作用は echi- で表される（胆振では単数目的語に対し e-...-ash、複数目的語に対し echi-...-ash）。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["colloquial register"]},"forms":["echi-","-ash"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0097-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-the-hidaka-region-and-the-mukawa-area","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"In the Hidaka region and the Mukawa area of Iburi, the incorporating forms with a first-person subject have collapsed, and echi- (e.g. echi-kore) is used for all combinations of a first-person subject acting on a second-person object.","ja":"日高および胆振の鵡川地方では第I人称を動主とする抱合形は崩れて、第I人称が第II人称に作用する全ての場合を echi-（例：echi-kore）で代用する。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/mukawa","doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["1st person subject acting on 2nd person object"]},"forms":["echi-","echi-kore"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0099-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-portmanteau-personal-affix-for-a-first-person","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"The portmanteau personal affix for a first-person singular subject acting on a second-person object (singular or plural) is 'eci=.","ja":"1人称単数の主語が2人称の目的語（単数または複数）に作用する場合の抱合人称接辞は 'eci= である。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["'eci="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0035-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-prefixal-personal-affix-eci-indexes-first-person","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"The prefixal personal affix 'eci= indexes first-person subject acting on second-person object ('I ... to you').","ja":"人称接辞 'eci= は1人称主語が2人称目的語に作用すること（「私がお前に」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["'eci="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0050-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-many-dialects-expressing-i-give-you-with","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"In many dialects, expressing 'I give you' with the transitive verb kore involves circumfixing personal affixes as e=kore=an or eci=kore=an, whereas in the Saru and Chitose group only prefixal eci=kore appears.","ja":"他動詞 kore「あげる」で「私があなたにあげる」を表す場合、多くの方言では e=kore=an や eci=kore=an のように前後に分かれて接辞がつくが、沙流・千歳方言グループでは接頭辞のみの eci=kore が現れる。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["1sg subject acting on 2sg/2pl object"]},"forms":["e=kore=an","eci=kore=an","eci=kore"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0106-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--no-dialect-exists-that-uses-ku-in-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"No dialect exists that uses ku= in the combination of first-person subject and second-person object.","ja":"1人称主格－2人称目的格の組み合わせで、ku= が用いられる方言は存在しない。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"none","modality":"actual","conditions":["1st person subject with 2nd person object"]},"forms":["ku="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0170-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--highly-irregular-portmanteau-forms-termed-nominative-objective-personal","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"Highly irregular portmanteau forms termed 'nominative-objective personal affixes' appear when combining first and second person (such as 'I ... you' or 'you ... me').","ja":"一人称と二人称を組み合わせた意味を表現したい場合（「私がお前を」あるいは「お前が私を」等）には、「主格・目的格人称接辞」と呼ばれる極めて不規則な特別な形式が現れる。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["combinations of 1st person and 2nd person"]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0049-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-chitose-ainu-an-action-from-first-person","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"In Chitose Ainu, an action from first person (singular or plural exclusive) to second person (singular or plural) is expressed by the irregular prefix eci- instead of *ku-e-.","ja":"千歳方言において、一人称（単数または除外的一人称複数）から二人称（単数または複数）への行為は、*ku-e- ではなく不規則な接辞 eci- で表される。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0163-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-1-2-prefix-eci-is-shared-between","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"The 1→2 prefix eci- is shared between Chitose and Saru dialects, but is often not understood in other dialects.","ja":"一人称から二人称への行為を表す形式としての eci- は千歳方言と沙流方言で共通しているが、他の方言では通じないことが多い。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose","doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0163-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-the-classical-register-unlike-colloquial-eci-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"In the classical register, unlike colloquial eci-, the combination of a first-person singular subject acting on a second-person singular object is marked by a-e-, and on a second-person plural object by a-ci-.","ja":"雅語では、口語の eci- とは異なり、一人称単数主格から二人称単数目的格への組み合わせは a-e-、一人称単数主格から二人称複数目的格への組み合わせは a-ci- で表示される。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["in the classical register"]},"forms":["a-e-","a-ci-","eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0279-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-prefix-eci-is-an-inseparable-portmanteau-morpheme","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"The prefix eci- is an inseparable portmanteau morpheme indicating both a first-person actor subject and a second-person undergoer object.","ja":"接頭辞 eci- は、動作主である1人称主語と被動者である2人称目的語の両方を表す、不可分なかばん形式である。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2025a@pdftotext-pieces/l0010-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-the-ishikari-dialect-the-combinations-of-1st","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--portmanteau"],"statement":{"en":"In the Ishikari dialect, the combinations of 1st-person subject and 2nd-person object are not collapsed into eci-.","ja":"石狩方言では、1人称主語と2人称目的語の接辞の組み合わせが eci- に統合される現象は見られない。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/central/ishikari"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0023-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-the-chitose-dialect-according-to-sato-2008a","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--resolving-syncretism"],"statement":{"en":"In the Chitose dialect, according to Sato (2008a), the combination of second-person plural subject and first-person object is also expressed as en= and un=.","ja":"佐藤（2008a）によれば、千歳方言では2人称複数主格－1人称目的格も en=、un= となる。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["2nd person plural subject with 1st person object"]},"forms":["en=","un="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0170-04","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--for-actions-from-second-person-plural-to-first","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--resolving-syncretism"],"statement":{"en":"For actions from second-person plural to first person (singular or plural), forms with overt subject indexing eci-en- and eci-un- have also been reported.","ja":"二人称複数から一人称（単数または複数）への行為を表す形式として、eci-en- や eci-un- という形式も報告されている。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-en-","eci-un-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0164-02","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-suffixes-in-parentheses-es-in-tables-3","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--resolving-syncretism"],"statement":{"en":"The suffixes in parentheses (-es-) in Tables 3.4–3.6 are unique to the Ishikari dialect.","ja":"表3.4〜3.6の括弧内の接尾辞（-es-）は石狩方言特有のものである。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/central/ishikari"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-es-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0023-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-colloquial-ainu-the-transitive-subject-object-combinations","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--resolving-syncretism"],"statement":{"en":"In Colloquial Ainu, the transitive subject-object combinations ku-e- 'I-you', ku-eci- 'I-you(PL)', ci-e- 'we-you', and ci-eci- 'we-you(PL)' have all collapsed and neutralized to eci-.","ja":"口語アイヌ語において、他動詞主語と目的語の組み合わせである ku-e-「私-あなた」、ku-eci-「私-あなたがた」、ci-e-「私たち-あなた」、ci-eci-「私たち-あなたがた」はすべて融合・中和し、eci- に縮約された。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["Colloquial Ainu","except Ishikari dialect"]},"forms":["eci-","ku-e-","ku-eci-","ci-e-","ci-eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0023-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-karafuto-ainu-esutoru-an-appears-when-a","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--resolving-syncretism"],"statement":{"en":"In Karafuto Ainu (Esutoru), an- appears when a first person and a second person plural participate in a subject-object or object-subject relation.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語（恵須取方言）では、1人称と2人称複数が主語・目的語関係または目的語・主語関係にある際に an- が現れる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["an-","-an"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:tangiku2022@handbook-epub/l0060-10","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-personal-affix-eci-functions-as-second-person","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"The personal affix eci- functions as second-person plural for A, S, and O, and also expresses 1SG.A+2SG.O, 1SG.A+2PL.O, 1PL.A+2SG.O, and 1PL.A+2PL.O.","ja":"人称接辞eci-はA、S、Oの二人称複数を表すほか、1SG.A+2SG.O、1SG.A+2PL.O、1PL.A+2SG.O、1PL.A+2PL.Oの意味を表すことができる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2008@pdftotext-pieces/l0011-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-portmanteau-eci-has-as-its-key-function","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"The portmanteau eci= has as its key function the marking of second-person plural for A, S, or O.","ja":"ポートマントー eci= は、A、S、またはOの2人称複数標識としての主要な機能をもつ。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0009-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-second-person-plural-subject-affix-for-1","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"The second-person plural subject affix for 1-valence verbs is es- in the Ishikari dialect and eci- in the other dialects.","ja":"1価動詞の2人称複数主語接辞は石狩方言でes-、それ以外の方言でeci-である。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["es-","eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2022pos@handbook-epub/l0091-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-the-ishikari-dialect-the-second-person-plural","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"In the Ishikari dialect, the second-person plural possessor prefix on ordinary nouns is es-, whereas in other dialects it is eci-.","ja":"石狩方言では普通名詞の二人称複数所有者接頭辞はes-であるが、それ以外の方言ではeci-である。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/central/ishikari"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["es-","eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2022pos@handbook-epub/l0093-12","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-second-person-plural-subjective-personal-affix-is","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"The second-person plural subjective personal affix is eci-.","ja":"二人称複数主格の人称接辞は eci- である。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0047-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
