{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-second-person-plural-objective-person-affix-is","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"The second-person plural objective person affix is eci- ('you pl.').","ja":"二人称複数の目的格人称接辞は eci-「お前達を，お前達に」である。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0137-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-classical-ainu-the-second-person-plural-intransitive","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"In Classical Ainu, the second-person plural intransitive subject is marked by the prefix eci-.","ja":"古典アイヌ語において、2人称複数の自動詞主語は接頭辞 eci- によって標示される。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["Classical Ainu"]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0021-16","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-classical-ainu-the-second-person-plural-transitive","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"In Classical Ainu, the second-person plural transitive subject is marked by the prefix eci-.","ja":"古典アイヌ語において、2人称複数の他動詞主語は接頭辞 eci- によって標示される。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["Classical Ainu"]},"forms":["eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0021-20","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--in-the-saru-dialect-the-second-person-plural","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"In the Saru dialect, the second-person plural pronoun is 'eci'oká (sometimes 'eci'oká 'utar to emphasize a large crowd), and the affix is 'eci- without distinction between nominative and objective case.","ja":"沙流方言の2人称複数の代名詞は 'eci'oká（大勢であることを強調するために 'eci'oká 'utar と言うこともある）で、接辞は主格・目的格の区別なく 'eci- である。"},"type":"paradigm-cell","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["'eci'oká","'eci'oká 'utar","'eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:tamura1972@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0012-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--the-second-person-plural-form-is-used-for","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"The second-person plural form is used for two or more people on the addressee's side (including third parties belonging to the addressee's group), except when a woman addresses an adult male.","ja":"2人称複数の形式は相手側の2人以上（相手側に属する第三者を含む場合もある）に対して用いられるが、女が成人の男子に向かって言う場合を除く。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":["相手側の二人以上","女が成人の男子に向かって言う場合を除く"]},"forms":["'eci'oká","'eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:tamura1972@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0012-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--when-the-addressees-are-two-or-more-women","revision":1,"topic":"topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topics":["topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural","topic:person/eci-portmanteau-and-second-plural--two-functions"],"statement":{"en":"When the addressees are two or more women, the second-person plural form is used.","ja":"相手が二人以上の女である場合はもちろん2人称複数形を用いる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["相手が二人以上の女である場合"]},"forms":["'eci'oká","'eci-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:tamura1972@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0014-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
